 "text": "Hello! How's everything today? Sandwiches, salads, fruit, and yoghurt are the simplest to pack and eat without a refrigerator. Cooked chicken goes off faster than you think. Keep it in the coldest part of the pack, away from your body, and eat it within two days. You can still have a great picnic without it. That's another option. A small cooler with ice keeps things cool for a full day. A big pot of berry babka and a big jar of jam is hard to beat.",
